# Presence of this marker tells scripts/check-examples.sh to build this example
# against the in-tree crates/ (with the [patch.crates-io] block toggled on),
# instead of the published crates.io versions the other examples build against.
#
# This example demonstrates unreleased executor API (IntegrityLevel /
# ExecutorBuilder::integrity_level, TSR_0009); those symbols do not exist in any
# published taktora-executor, so a patch-off build against crates.io cannot
# compile. It is built local-only until the API lands in a published release,
# at which point this marker is removed and the version pins track the new major
# like every other example.
